ion Making Digital technology speeds up product development from concept to final piece. Relying on digital samples enables faster, more informed decisions through enhanced collaboration. Accuracy that moves production forward Accuracy to Achieve Efficiency A good-looking 3D garment on screen isn’t enough—you need an accurate virtual twin. With precise digital garments, teams can collaborate seamlessly, ensuring approved samples are ready before production. Accuracy in fabric draping, pattern placement, and fit is essential to effective communication and successful outcomes. Learn More Connected teams start with shared data A Single Source of Truth to Communicate Between All Stakeholdersto Achieve As opposed to the traditional approval cycle of back and forth iterations between brands, manufacturers, and external stakeholders, when digital tools are in the picture this process is made faster, more accurate, and cost-effective. Where connectivity drives efficiency Connectivity and Automation Our robust API integration enables brands to embed virtual twins seamlessly across all systems, driving scalability and automation from design to merchandising. With a fully digital, integrated workflow and access to our growing partner ecosystem on the Open Platform, brands can optimize their processes end-to-end. Learn More Insights that reduce risk Understanding the Consumer Gaining early consumer feedback on digital garments is key for sales and sustainability. Through Voice of Customer platforms, brands can showcase true-to-life designs, gather insights, and predict collection success, reducing the risk of garment write-offs. Bring products to market faster Selling More and Quickly Adapting to the Market Once your collections have been finalized, you’ll be able to seamlessly connect to the latest visualization tools that can be embedded directly into your eCommerce site. This will provide your customers with an immersive online shopping experience as well as increase consumer confidence. Stronger",
