able, sustainable product creation from concept to production. 1000 + Companies Worldwide 10 M+ Digital Garments Created 80 % Reduction in Fabric Waste 30 + Countries with Active Customers What We Deliver Four advantages that define the Browzwear platform Every tool we build, every integration we ship - designed to give fashion teams a faster, smarter, more connected way to work. 01 Unprecedented Speed Reduce time-to-market by designing and refining virtual garments in real time. Make quick, informed decisions with stakeholders, eliminating delays caused by physical prototyping. 02 Unmatched Precision Visualize designs with true-to-life detail. Achieve a perfect fit by addressing potential issues early in the process, reducing costly revisions and catching errors early. 03 Seamless Collaboration Share and iterate on designs with teams and manufacturers around the globe, fostering clear communication and faster decision-making across every time zone. 04 Unlimited Scale Reduce time-to-market by designing and refining virtual garments in real time. Make quick, informed decisions with stakeholders, eliminating delays caused by physical prototyping. Our journey 25 years of building the future of digital fashion From the first virtual dressing room to AI-powered fit validation, we've always been a step ahead. 2000 – 2002 The Beginning Pioneered the world's first virtual dressing room and 2D to 3D garment simulation, laying the foundation for digital fashion. 2003 – 2005 Industry Validation Collaborated with Nike and Adidas, proving the technology's power at the highest level of global fashion and sportswear. 2006 – 2009 Global Expansion Secured core patents for 3D simulation, launched the first digital catalog, and began scaling with global brands and tier-1 factories across Asia. 2010 – 2013 Platform Maturity Established Singapore headquarters, launched an all-new VStitcher, and introduced Stylezone for collaborative collection management. 2014 – 2019 Ecosystem Growth Launched Lotta for appar",
